abstract: "Independent influenza forecasting reproduction and 28-implementation evaluation across accuracy, peak skill, parameter efficiency and statistical evidence. Reproduction mean MSE 1.4995 versus paper 1.4355 (+4.5%). Correct Holm rejects 0/136 pairs at the present exact-test resolution; this does not establish equivalence. Single-split findings and adapted implementations remain limited; manuscript not submission-ready."
